	"descriptionMarkdown": "#### Mid-game Mall\n\nMy take on creating most of the common items in mid-game\n\nUpdate 11/8/2026 (v0.6):\n- Updated circuit logic in several places to work with Factorio 2.1\n\nFor the last Factorio 2.0 version, see [v0.5 on GitHub](https://github.com/niradar/factorio_blueprints/blob/main/blueprints/malls/midgame-mall/0.5.txt).\n\n\nUpdate 7/5/2026 (v0.5):\n- Reworked large parts of the layout to make the mall more compact\n- Doubled steel production\n- Improved the foundry layout for faster throughput\n- Switched engine production from speed modules to productivity modules\n- Moved iron stick production from assembling machines to foundries\n- Added production for:\n  - Speakers\n  - Flamethrower turrets\n  - Gun turrets\n\nUpdate 7/5/2026 (v0.4):\n- Switched from buffer chests to storage chests",
